---
layout: base.njk
title: How it works — Toza
eleventyComputed:
  description: "Assess, Harden, Verify: how Dr. Lior Tabansky works on your devices and accounts in person. The first step is {{ facts.prices.assessment | ils }} and counts toward protection."
permalink: /en/how-it-works/index.html
---
<section class="pt-6 pb-10 lg:pt-20 lg:pb-28" aria-labelledby="h1">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-x-16 gap-y-6 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:grid-rows-[auto_1fr] lg:[grid-template-areas:'copy_fig'_'act_fig'] max-lg:[grid-template-areas:'copy'_'fig'_'act']">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 [grid-area:copy]">
      <h1 id="h1" class="display text-[2.625rem] sm:text-6xl lg:text-[4.25rem] !text-ink">Work through your concerns with the person who makes changes.</h1>
      <p class="mt-5 lg:mt-8 text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-[34rem] text-text">You do not have to work out what is wrong before you meet. Dr. Lior Tabansky assesses your devices and accounts with you, hardens them around your risks and tests the changes.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="[grid-area:fig] lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 flex items-center gap-4 lg:block">
      <div class="frame shrink-0 w-24 h-24 lg:w-full lg:h-auto lg:aspect-square">
        <img class="portrait" src="/assets/img/dr-tabansky-portrait-square-640.webp" width="640" height="640" alt="{{ t.ui.portraitAlt }}" fetchpriority="high">
      </div>
      <figcaption class="lg:mt-9">
        <p class="font-serif text-xl lg:text-2xl text-ink">{{ t.person.name }}</p>
        <p class="text-[0.9375rem] lg:text-base text-muted leading-snug">{{ t.person.tagline }}</p>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="[grid-area:act] lg:col-span-7 lg:self-start">
      {% include "cta-hero.njk" %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="on-ink bg-ink text-paper section" aria-labelledby="stages-h">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 id="stages-h" class="h2 !text-paper">{{ t.stages.heading }}</h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-paper/85">Each stage has its own result.</p>

    <ol class="objs mt-8 lg:mt-14">
      <li class="hstage">
        <div class="hs-obj" dir="ltr">{% include "drawing-assess.njk" %}</div>
        <p class="hs-label">1 · {{ t.stages.assess.name }}</p>
        <h3 class="hs-h">Your threat model, your risks in order, and urgent first aid.</h3>
        <div class="hs-body">
          <p>Dr. Tabansky starts with your situation: what changed, what concerns you, which accounts matter and who previously had legitimate access. He then examines how your devices, identities and accounts are connected, and what those connections allow.</p>
          <p class="keep"><span class="keep-l">You keep</span> A written exposure summary of what was reviewed, found and changed, what remains, and your next steps in order.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="hstage">
        <div class="hs-obj" dir="ltr">{% include "drawing-harden.njk" %}</div>
        <p class="hs-label">2 · {{ t.stages.harden.name }}</p>
        <h3 class="hs-h">Settings, accounts and recovery rebuilt around your risks. Security keys supplied and configured.</h3>
        <div class="hs-body">
          <p class="font-serif text-xl text-paper">{{ t.stages.method }}</p>
          <p>The work can include closing unwanted access, strengthening sign-in and recovery, and changing sharing permissions. Dr. Tabansky explains each material change and its effects before you approve it.</p>
          <p class="keep"><span class="keep-l">You keep</span> Your phone, computer, accounts and home network, hardened around your risks.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
      <li class="hstage">
        <div class="hs-obj obj-record" dir="ltr">{% include "drawing-verify.njk" %}
          <p class="obj-date" aria-hidden="true"><span class="font-semibold">{{ t.stages.recordDate[0] }}</span><span>{{ t.stages.recordDate[1] }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <p class="hs-label">3 · {{ t.stages.verify.name }}</p>
        <h3 class="hs-h">Changes tested and checked, and you are taught to use them. A private dated record of the work.</h3>
        <div class="hs-body">
          <p>Dr. Tabansky works with you on granting access, sharing information, signing in and recovering accounts. You learn how to use the changed arrangements in daily life. Every tier includes a follow-up visit after about four weeks.</p>
          <p class="keep"><span class="keep-l">You keep</span> A private dated record of the work, one for each person.</p>
        </div>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section bg-paper-deep" aria-labelledby="first-h">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <div class="lg:col-span-5">
      <p class="step-tag">{{ t.price.startHere }}</p>
      <h2 id="first-h" class="h2 mt-4">A senior check-up of your digital life.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 font-serif text-xl text-ink">{{ t.price.assessment.name }}</p>
      <p class="mt-2"><span class="numeral text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-ink">{{ facts.prices.assessment | ils }}</span></p>
    </div>
    <div class="lg:col-span-6 lg:col-start-7">
      <p class="text-lg lg:text-xl leading-relaxed text-text">Half a day in person with Dr. Tabansky, urgent first aid on the spot, and a written exposure summary you keep whether or not you continue.</p>
      <ul class="entries mt-5 grid gap-2 text-lg">
        <li>Covers {{ facts.assessmentScope }}.</li>
        <li>Urgent first aid with your approval, including removing a malicious app or profile where that can be done safely.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-6 font-serif text-xl lg:text-2xl leading-snug text-ink">{{ t.price.credit | fill({ days: facts.credit.windowDays }) }}</p>
      <p class="mt-4"><a class="link font-semibold" href="/en/conditions/">{{ t.price.conditions }} <span class="flip" aria-hidden="true">{{ t.ui.arrow }}</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" aria-labelledby="tiers-h">
  <div class="wrap grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16">
    <h2 id="tiers-h" class="h2 lg:col-span-5">Then the protection that fits your household.</h2>
    <div class="lg:col-span-7 lg:col-start-6">
      <ul class="border-b border-rule">
        <li class="tierrow"><span class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">{{ t.price.shield.name }}</span><span class="numeral text-4xl text-ink">{{ facts.prices.personalShield | ils }}</span><span class="tr-for">For one person.</span></li>
        <li class="tierrow"><span class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">{{ t.price.two.name }}</span><span class="numeral text-4xl text-ink">{{ facts.prices.shieldForTwo | ils }}</span><span class="tr-for">For you and one other person.</span></li>
        <li class="tierrow"><span class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink">{{ t.price.inner.name }}</span><span class="numeral text-4xl text-ink">{{ facts.prices.innerCircle | ils }}</span><span class="tr-for">For a household of up to four.</span></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 text-lg">
        <p>The first step is included. Each price is fixed and agreed in writing before work begins.</p>
        <p>Every tier includes questions answered by WhatsApp or Signal within one working day, for {{ facts.questionLineDays }} days.</p>
        <p>{{ t.price.care | fill({ price: facts.prices.annualCareFrom | ils }) }}</p>
      </div>
      <p class="mt-6"><a class="link font-semibold" href="/en/pricing/">{{ t.price.allTiers }} <span class="flip" aria-hidden="true">{{ t.ui.arrow }}</span></a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set contactNote = '' %}
{% include "contact-block.njk" %}
